WEBVTT

00:00.970 --> 00:02.980
I am Ikusaba Asahi.

00:02.980 --> 00:05.580
I was summoned to
this world only recently,

00:05.580 --> 00:08.480
and right now, I'm in the
middle of a slime-hunting quest

00:08.480 --> 00:09.980
as a novice adventurer.

00:16.990 --> 00:22.150
I'm embarrassed to say that I can
finally beat a single slime easily.

00:22.150 --> 00:23.530
That's the level I'm at.

00:23.960 --> 00:27.420
And this is my big sister, Ikusaba Maya.

00:27.420 --> 00:31.110
Big Sis Fire!

00:32.700 --> 00:36.230
What's "Big Sis Fire"?
Is it an attack name?

00:36.950 --> 00:39.600
Looks like you took care
of things on your end, too.

00:39.600 --> 00:42.120
You're amazing. I'm so proud of you!

00:42.120 --> 00:44.600
What a capable little brother!
Here's your reward!

00:44.600 --> 00:46.050
H-Hey, wait!

00:46.050 --> 00:47.180
Maya-nee!

00:47.180 --> 00:52.140
So now I'm starting life in another world
with a sister who's got cheat-level power,

00:52.140 --> 00:54.410
and a cheat-level brother obsession.

02:38.920 --> 02:43.380
We have driven off dragons,
yet we have been reduced to this.

02:45.350 --> 02:47.270
Tell me your name, villain!

02:48.270 --> 02:55.070
I am simply someone who is
far stronger than any dragon.

02:57.400 --> 03:00.120
You...

03:11.540 --> 03:13.630
What a bore.

03:13.630 --> 03:16.550
Each of them fell after just one hit.

03:16.550 --> 03:21.530
Where can I find a fearless fighter who
can entertain me properly?

03:24.490 --> 03:27.080
Huh? Maya-nee, did you catch a cold?

03:30.100 --> 03:31.270
Sigh.

03:31.720 --> 03:34.420
It's because you're always dressed like that.

03:35.420 --> 03:37.320
You're hopeless.

03:37.320 --> 03:38.650
Here. Take this.

03:40.690 --> 03:42.050
Asahi.

03:43.490 --> 03:45.950
In that case, why don't you warm me up...

03:46.370 --> 03:48.140
with your body heat!

03:49.460 --> 03:52.340
We're going down this route again?!

03:55.320 --> 03:58.130
I can't keep relying on Maya-nee forever.

03:58.700 --> 04:02.780
For now, I'll take on a quest I should
be able to complete on my own.

04:09.300 --> 04:13.220
I'm so glad I followed Asahi to this world.

04:14.060 --> 04:18.490
After all, I get to be with Asahi from when we say
"Good morning!" to when we say "Good night!"

04:19.610 --> 04:24.850
I bet he's in the next room
thinking the exact same thing.

04:28.530 --> 04:30.730
I don't sense his presence in the next room.

04:34.340 --> 04:35.390
Asahi?

04:39.020 --> 04:40.050
This is...

04:43.880 --> 04:44.970
Still warm.

04:45.780 --> 04:47.850
He can't have gone very far.

04:48.070 --> 04:50.490
Hm, somewhere close where Asahi might go...

04:51.280 --> 04:52.350
Actually...

04:52.580 --> 04:54.990
What about this bed?

04:57.060 --> 04:59.360
I can feel Asahi's warmth!

05:01.530 --> 05:02.940
And this scent...

05:03.670 --> 05:06.450
Is this paradise?!

05:06.980 --> 05:08.620
Quest contracts?

05:08.620 --> 05:10.700
Just a moment, please.

05:10.970 --> 05:13.070
Thanks. I'm in your hands, Tanya.

05:13.070 --> 05:17.290
If I had to recommend the perfect quest
to match your Ogre Class rank...

05:17.500 --> 05:19.130
How about one of these?

05:19.130 --> 05:22.350
Troll-hunting, or a quest
to swipe a wyvern's egg.

05:22.350 --> 05:23.360
What do you think?

05:23.360 --> 05:25.670
Both of them have
high difficulty levels!

05:25.670 --> 05:28.590
And there's no way I can do either on my own.

05:28.590 --> 05:32.600
I have to get her to give me
a quest I can finish up quickly.

05:32.600 --> 05:36.060
If I'm late back and Maya-nee
gets worried, she might show up.

05:36.740 --> 05:40.440
I-Isn't there anything easy
and close to town, Tanya?

05:41.400 --> 05:45.080
There are only Rabbit and
Goblin Class quests near here.

05:46.490 --> 05:49.190
I don't want to forget
how it felt when I started out.

05:49.190 --> 05:53.590
And if any danger befell the town,
I'd be able to rush back here, right?

05:53.590 --> 05:55.160
Oh, I see!

05:55.160 --> 05:57.450
You really are amazing, Asahi-kun! AmazAsa!

05:57.450 --> 05:59.960
Well, if you want something quick and easy...

06:00.430 --> 06:05.600
What about this one? Gathering rainbow
mushrooms in the Claudio Forest.

06:05.600 --> 06:09.010
It might not be all that fulfilling for
someone who's Ogre Class, though.

06:10.010 --> 06:14.000
No matter how small the request might be,
someone still has to fulfill it, right?

06:14.000 --> 06:16.270
Right! Then, I'll leave it to you.

06:16.270 --> 06:20.380
If it's just searching for mushrooms,
I should be able to handle it without Maya-nee.

06:20.380 --> 06:24.010
I'll finish it up quickly and earn EXP
and mani to pay for the room at the inn.

06:27.270 --> 06:29.030
Whoa! Here they are!

06:30.150 --> 06:34.080
So this is a rainbow mushroom, huh?
What amazing coloring.

06:34.080 --> 06:35.240
Still...

06:35.570 --> 06:38.110
I was told I'd find lots of them
in this little-known spot,

06:38.440 --> 06:40.830
but there aren't any
other adventurers here.

06:41.110 --> 06:42.260
Why is that?

06:47.090 --> 06:51.860
B-But it's probably pretty rare
to run into a bear, right?

06:51.860 --> 06:53.390
Yeah...

06:58.690 --> 07:01.780
I should've kept my mouth shut!

07:04.170 --> 07:06.220
This is no time for picking mushrooms!

07:06.750 --> 07:10.450
But Maya-nee isn't around right now,
so I have to deal with this myself.

07:10.990 --> 07:12.950
Stone Throw!

07:19.080 --> 07:20.500
Yup, that figures.

07:20.500 --> 07:22.250
No way! I can't! I can't! I can't!

07:34.610 --> 07:37.060
The ridiculously powerful magic...

07:37.470 --> 07:40.310
And the feel of this chest...

07:41.160 --> 07:43.580
I see. It's Maya-nee, isn't it?

07:46.140 --> 07:49.340
I'm sorry. You ended up
having to save me again.

07:49.340 --> 07:52.390
I guess I really am useless
without my big sister.

07:52.390 --> 07:55.400
Oh? You call me your sister?

07:55.400 --> 07:56.240
Huh?

08:02.830 --> 08:04.820
It isn't<i> Maya-nee?</i>

08:04.820 --> 08:06.170
Who is this person?

08:06.170 --> 08:08.880
And what are those horns on her head?

08:09.270 --> 08:10.670
Incidentally...

08:10.960 --> 08:13.530
How long do you intend
to keep clinging on to me?

08:13.530 --> 08:14.890
S-Sorry!

08:16.590 --> 08:20.270
"Big sister," huh? Strangely,
being called that doesn't displease me.

08:21.940 --> 08:24.020
You have set my heart racing, young man.

08:24.020 --> 08:26.730
Oh, um, I just...

08:26.730 --> 08:28.800
I mistook you for someone else.

08:28.800 --> 08:31.030
But anyway, thanks for saving me.

08:32.900 --> 08:33.680
Oh dear.

08:34.090 --> 08:36.490
Seems your gratitude
was a little premature.

08:36.490 --> 08:38.160
Huh? What? What?

08:38.450 --> 08:40.000
What?

08:40.000 --> 08:44.620
Fret not. No matter how many
weaklings amass, they are still weak.

09:11.960 --> 09:13.940
Th-That was amazing.

09:15.620 --> 09:18.570
I came to test my strength
by eliminating some bears.

09:19.060 --> 09:21.660
You did a good job as bait.

09:27.120 --> 09:28.740
Thirteen.

09:28.740 --> 09:30.660
Thirteen of them.

09:30.660 --> 09:32.750
You dare do that to my followers?!

09:33.390 --> 09:35.630
It's unforgivable!

09:35.630 --> 09:39.380
A-A huge bear?
And it's wearing clothes and <i>talking</i>?

09:40.470 --> 09:44.470
I thought it might eventually show itself
if I kept hunting bears in this area.

09:44.700 --> 09:47.020
This is the guardian of Claudio Forest:

09:47.660 --> 09:49.370
Kaiser Bear.

09:50.930 --> 09:54.990
"She loves battling and hunts
fellow demons to test her strength."

09:55.240 --> 09:58.570
That is something that is often
said of Kilmaria of Corruption.

10:00.760 --> 10:02.240
What lovely compliments.

10:02.740 --> 10:06.250
I only came to gather mushrooms!
How'd I get into this<i> situation?!</i>

10:06.560 --> 10:09.780
All of a sudden, a "Defeat the
Raid Boss" event has started!

10:09.780 --> 10:13.630
Though, if I manage to land even one
hit on it, I'll probably get a ton of EXP.

10:19.120 --> 10:20.470
I'm gonna die! I'm gonna die!

10:20.790 --> 10:21.890
Buddha, Dharma, and Sangha!

10:22.390 --> 10:23.720
Young man.

10:26.480 --> 10:29.810
You shall know my wrath!

10:38.780 --> 10:39.820
I defeated her.

10:47.110 --> 10:49.210
She was able to b-block it?

10:49.480 --> 10:53.090
You thought flames of that
caliber might consume me?

10:53.090 --> 10:55.090
Even if in jest, that's not funny.

10:55.090 --> 10:57.670
Y-You chose to save me again?

10:58.580 --> 11:02.140
You called me your "big sister,"
so I have to save my little brother, no?

11:03.890 --> 11:05.330
Stand back.

11:06.310 --> 11:08.810
Now, it's my turn.

11:09.290 --> 11:11.230
As a farewell gift to take to the afterlife...

11:12.250 --> 11:14.730
I will show you what <i>real</i> flames look like!

11:15.300 --> 11:17.940
Disappear in the ferocious flames of hell.

11:19.820 --> 11:24.910
Crimson Blaze!

11:39.350 --> 11:41.880
What's this? Not even a trace left?

11:42.220 --> 11:46.470
I thought perhaps the king of the
bears might be able to satisfy me,

11:46.970 --> 11:48.390
but it's another one-hit KO.

11:49.760 --> 11:51.390
What a bore.

11:51.390 --> 11:53.580
Sh-She's incredibly powerful!

11:53.580 --> 11:56.860
She's as strong as Maya-nee.
No, maybe even stronger...

11:57.110 --> 11:58.890
Are you hurt, young man?

11:59.210 --> 12:01.320
Oh, no, I'm fine.

12:01.320 --> 12:03.820
Um, who exactly are you?

12:04.170 --> 12:07.060
Are you what people might call a demon?

12:08.500 --> 12:10.750
I'm a top-ranking officer
in the Demon King's army,

12:10.750 --> 12:12.700
one of the Demon King's Six Generals:

12:13.260 --> 12:15.110
Kilmaria of Corruption.

12:15.830 --> 12:17.690
A top-ranking officer in
the Demon King's army?

12:18.010 --> 12:21.200
What?! I feel like she just used
an incredible string of words!

12:21.200 --> 12:25.440
Like, the Warring Triad, the Four Devas,
or the Seven Heroes! She's someone like that?

12:25.440 --> 12:27.440
Seriously? This early in an RPG?

12:27.440 --> 12:31.600
Don't worry, young man. I have zero
interest in weaklings. I will not attack you.

12:31.600 --> 12:32.350
What?

12:32.630 --> 12:33.730
I see.

12:33.730 --> 12:37.450
Just because she's a demon doesn't mean
humans are automatically her enemy.

12:37.450 --> 12:40.810
And the truth is, she's saved me twice.

12:43.390 --> 12:46.430
A big sister who'd pounce on
her little brother doesn't exist!

12:46.430 --> 12:49.120
Uh, actually, she does,
and she's not too far from here.

12:49.120 --> 12:52.200
Oh, right. Young man,
I wanted to ask you something.

12:52.200 --> 12:54.870
Oh, sure. If it's something
I can answer, then I will.

12:55.590 --> 12:58.210
Do you know an adventurer
named Ikusaba Asahi?

12:59.090 --> 13:02.320
This person appeared
in the guild like a comet,

13:02.320 --> 13:05.060
and has gained much acclaim
as an adventurer, I hear.

13:05.450 --> 13:10.350
Defeating the Three Orc Brothers,
and a wyvern with one punch...

13:11.780 --> 13:14.080
One attack! Isn't that wonderful?

13:14.080 --> 13:16.520
Whoever it is might be
this generation's hero.

13:16.520 --> 13:18.560
I'd love to fight them to the death.

13:18.770 --> 13:22.760
This person is on a whole different level
of dangerous from those other enemies.

13:22.760 --> 13:24.950
Okay! Let's flee all casual-like.

13:24.950 --> 13:26.820
Carefully. Carefully...

13:29.530 --> 13:31.160
You dropped something.

13:31.160 --> 13:33.660
"Ikusaba Asahi."

13:36.500 --> 13:40.500
I see. So you're the adventurer
they're all talking about, are you?

13:42.920 --> 13:47.430
It seems I must correct my earlier
statement when I called you weak.

13:47.430 --> 13:49.920
Can't judge a book by its cover, huh?

13:50.400 --> 13:53.890
No, what you see really is
what you get with me.

13:54.870 --> 13:55.960
What do I do now?

13:59.050 --> 14:00.180
Asahi?

14:07.230 --> 14:09.430
She's way more dangerous than a bear!

14:10.020 --> 14:11.740
Young man, why are you running away?

14:11.740 --> 14:14.570
Because you're chasing me!

14:14.570 --> 14:16.410
Oh, don't be so cold.

14:16.410 --> 14:19.370
Now, come and fight your
big sister to the death.

14:19.370 --> 14:21.120
This is so not funny!

14:21.120 --> 14:22.790
She'd end it in one turn!

14:22.790 --> 14:24.380
And flying is cheating!

14:24.380 --> 14:26.210
Caught you—

14:28.170 --> 14:30.340
Wh-What is this tremendous power?

14:33.310 --> 14:36.990
This sensation. This scent.
This time, for sure, it's...

14:37.930 --> 14:39.290
Maya-nee!

14:39.600 --> 14:41.530
Are you all right, Asahi?

14:41.900 --> 14:43.890
Y-Yeah, somehow.

14:44.400 --> 14:48.240
What did you mean by "this time,
for sure"? Was there some other—

14:48.240 --> 14:50.460
No! It's nothing! I got confused!

14:51.350 --> 14:53.600
Was it you who attacked me just now?

14:53.600 --> 14:56.670
You interrupted my
battle with Ikusaba Asahi.

14:56.670 --> 14:58.160
What an insensitive woman.

14:59.980 --> 15:03.460
I sensed Asahi was in danger
and hurried over here.

15:04.030 --> 15:05.490
It's just as I suspected.

15:06.960 --> 15:09.220
Asahi's virtue is at risk!

15:10.970 --> 15:13.640
Assaulting Asahi in such
an outrageous outfit...

15:13.640 --> 15:15.600
How could it be anything else?

15:15.600 --> 15:18.460
I mean, I do understand.
Asahi is adorable, after all.

15:18.460 --> 15:20.850
I totally understand the
urge to pounce on him.

15:20.850 --> 15:22.980
I have to admit, I feel exactly the same way!

15:22.980 --> 15:24.640
What are you <i>saying</i>, Maya-nee?!

15:24.640 --> 15:27.730
No, I simply want to go
one round with this young man.

15:27.730 --> 15:31.590
Go one round? So you <i>do</i> intend
to pounce on him, you hussy!

15:31.590 --> 15:33.780
That's not what she meant by a round!

15:33.780 --> 15:37.800
You're calling <i>me</i> a hussy?
When you're dressed like <i>that</i>?

15:38.150 --> 15:40.540
Asahi likes this look.

15:42.820 --> 15:43.870
Oh, does he now?

15:43.870 --> 15:44.980
Hang on. Maya-nee?

15:44.980 --> 15:47.880
Yes. Asahi may look adorable,
but in truth, he's unexpectedly—

15:47.880 --> 15:50.510
That's not something we need
to talk about right now!

15:50.840 --> 15:52.090
Regardless...

15:52.090 --> 15:53.760
I don't know who you are,

15:53.760 --> 15:56.700
but if you intend to interfere,
I will show you no mercy!

15:56.850 --> 15:58.450
That's my line!

16:03.950 --> 16:05.150
Hang on...

16:05.150 --> 16:07.480
That one hit didn't end it?!

16:08.310 --> 16:11.240
They're equal? These two are equal?

16:15.080 --> 16:17.430
I see. I understand now.

16:18.280 --> 16:21.790
Ikusaba Asahi's fame is the
result of <i>your</i> accomplishments.

16:23.290 --> 16:25.920
I'm so happy. Oh so happy!

16:25.920 --> 16:28.880
It's been a while since a fight
didn't end on the first blow!

16:29.310 --> 16:32.300
You're happy? What a strange woman.

16:43.140 --> 16:46.400
A-Amazing. They're both way
outside of normal parameters.

16:48.100 --> 16:49.070
But...

17:01.080 --> 17:03.160
She can hold her own against me?

17:04.000 --> 17:06.210
Am I... going to lose?

17:06.600 --> 17:08.590
I didn't know a human like this existed.

17:11.920 --> 17:14.340
I'll burn you to cinders.

17:16.580 --> 17:20.560
I-If she gets hit with that,
even Maya-nee won't...

17:22.330 --> 17:25.270
Fearful Flare!

17:26.900 --> 17:28.810
Big Sis Cyclone!

17:40.650 --> 17:43.800
I... have been defeated?

17:44.320 --> 17:46.250
What is your name?

17:47.100 --> 17:47.980
Maya.

17:48.490 --> 17:49.820
Ikusaba Maya.

17:50.610 --> 17:51.850
Ikusaba?

17:51.850 --> 17:55.320
I see. So you're the young man's big sister.

17:57.120 --> 17:59.050
You should finish me off.

18:01.370 --> 18:02.670
Wait!

18:04.720 --> 18:05.970
Asahi?

18:05.970 --> 18:10.110
Oh, I get it! You want me to let you deliver
the final blow, so you can get the EXP, right?

18:10.110 --> 18:11.810
I see! Genius! What a tactician!

18:11.810 --> 18:15.240
That's not it! Just how cruel do
you think your little brother is?

18:15.740 --> 18:19.750
This person saved me from monsters twice.

18:19.750 --> 18:23.490
She's a top-ranking officer in the Demon
King's army, but she isn't a bad person.

18:23.490 --> 18:27.480
You want me to let her go? This woman
was planning on stealing your virtue!

18:27.480 --> 18:31.150
Can you really say that when <i>you</i>
pounce on me every day, Maya-nee?

18:31.150 --> 18:32.500
Plus, she wasn't.

18:32.500 --> 18:36.170
What <i>I</i> do is physical affection
between family! Simple human contact!

18:36.170 --> 18:39.130
Your eyes go all bloodshot and
you start panting every time!

18:39.450 --> 18:42.510
You intend to show pity on me, young man?

18:42.510 --> 18:44.010
This isn't some joke.

18:44.460 --> 18:46.020
My name isn't "young man."

18:46.630 --> 18:48.520
It's Ikusaba Asahi.

18:51.570 --> 18:55.020
A big sister should listen to
her little brother sometimes.

18:57.030 --> 19:01.160
Like, seriously. Listen to your
little bro sometimes, big sis!

19:01.160 --> 19:03.530
You follow your whims way too much!

19:05.540 --> 19:08.030
Come on. Let's go, Maya-nee.

19:08.030 --> 19:09.790
Yes, all right.

19:10.230 --> 19:12.500
About what you said before...

19:12.500 --> 19:14.550
Who did you confuse for who?

19:14.550 --> 19:17.470
Don't tell me you confused me with that...

19:17.470 --> 19:18.800
Um, well... Oh, that's right!

19:18.800 --> 19:21.720
What do you want to eat tonight? I'll cook.

19:21.720 --> 19:25.470
What? I'd be happy with <i>anything</i>
if you're the one cooking, Asahi!

19:25.470 --> 19:27.430
Well, what about something
with mushrooms, then?

19:27.430 --> 19:28.280
Maya and Asahi.
Well, what about something
with mushrooms, then?

19:28.280 --> 19:29.480
Maya and Asahi.

19:31.140 --> 19:33.420
I've met some very interesting siblings.

19:34.090 --> 19:36.480
But one of the Demon King's Six Generals?

19:36.920 --> 19:40.720
She's definitely in a different league
from the monsters we've seen up to now.

19:40.720 --> 19:42.990
To be honest, she's strong.

19:42.990 --> 19:47.450
But you beat an opponent like her solo, and
very easily. You're crazy amazing, Maya-nee.

19:47.700 --> 19:51.560
Fighting like you did,
I'm amazed you didn't run out of MP.

19:51.560 --> 19:54.340
Yes! As you can see, I'm fine!

19:55.170 --> 19:56.320
Oh no!

19:57.430 --> 20:00.720
I'm out of MP and can't walk anymore!
Give me a piggyback ride!

20:00.720 --> 20:03.720
You liar! You were totally fine
just a second ago!

20:03.720 --> 20:08.210
In this moment, I understand that
woman's desire to pounce on Asahi!

20:08.210 --> 20:13.730
Please save me, Kilmaria!

20:15.360 --> 20:16.860
Thank you for the meal!

20:19.950 --> 20:22.910
Wow! I didn't think it would be,
but this mushroom is kinda good.

20:22.910 --> 20:27.180
Of course it is! It's something you
risked your life to pick, after all.

20:27.180 --> 20:30.870
In the beginning, it was supposed to
be an easier quest than that, though.

20:31.220 --> 20:34.790
Oh, and yeah...
"Big Sis Fire"? "Big Sis Cyclone"?

20:34.790 --> 20:38.160
Maya-nee, the way you
name stuff is kinda simplistic.

20:38.160 --> 20:40.340
But they're seriously powerful, right?

20:40.340 --> 20:44.230
But Kilmaria's attack names were cool,

20:44.230 --> 20:47.290
so the contrast between
them was pretty noticeable.

20:48.090 --> 20:52.240
I cannot let it be said that my naming sense
is worse than that half-naked horned woman.

20:52.240 --> 20:55.350
I need cooler names. Cooler names...

20:57.440 --> 20:59.840
What about "Big Sis Hurricane"?

20:59.840 --> 21:02.990
How about we start by
dropping the "Big Sis"?

22:33.760 --> 22:38.040
Maya-nee, why don't you go take a bath?
I'll take care of the dishes.

22:38.040 --> 22:40.050
Yes, you're right.

22:40.050 --> 22:43.560
I can't possibly join you in your
bed with how dirty I am, Asahi.

22:43.560 --> 22:45.550
You don't have to get into my bed.

22:45.870 --> 22:48.510
Then, I'll go ahead and
have my bath before you.

22:48.510 --> 22:50.430
No peeking, Asahi!

22:50.430 --> 22:51.720
As if I'd peek.

23:21.790 --> 23:23.480
You're really not going to peek?!

23:23.480 --> 23:25.290
You told me not to!

23:25.290 --> 23:27.710
We used to take baths
together all the time, right?

23:27.710 --> 23:32.950
Why are you bringing up ancient history?
Just put some clothes on already!

23:36.340 --> 23:39.440
Next time: "My Sister, Maya-nee, Is All I Need."
